<title>USA: UNILAB to take Q4 charge of about $4.5 mln.</title>
<headline>UNILAB to take Q4 charge of about $4.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>TARZANA, Calif. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>UNILAB Corp said on Friday it would take a non-recurring charge of about $4.5 million in the fourth quarter in connection with the sale of participation interest in a promissory note.</p>
<p>The company said it had sold to Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp, for $11 million cash, a 100 percent participation interest in its rights under a $15 million face value promissory note payable by Unilab Group Ltd and UniHolding Corp.</p>
</text>
